{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "familyroots-api-local",
    "name": "FamilyRoots API",
    "description": "Family Tree API — Part 0–5.\n\n**Flow:** Auth → Login → Persons → Logs.\n\n**Error format:** `{ \"error\": { \"code\", \"message\" } }`",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "baseUrl", "value": "http://localhost:3000" }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "General",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Root — API info",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/",
            "description": "**200 OK**\n```json\n{ \"data\": { \"name\": \"Family Tree API\", \"version\": \"v1\" } }\n```"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Health",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Health check",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/health",
            "description": "**200 OK** `{ \"status\": \"ok\" }`"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Auth",
      "description": "Login dengan kode keluarga `{ABBREV}{DDMMYY}` dari **fullName** (bukan nickname). Contoh: `MIA210399`, `MR170845`, `BA200175`.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Login — demo MR170845",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "  const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "  pm.environment.set('accessToken', json.data.accessToken);",
                  "  pm.environment.set('refreshToken', json.data.refreshToken);",
                  "  pm.environment.set('personId', String(json.data.person.id));",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"code\": \"MR170845\",\n  \"remember\": true\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login",
            "description": "**Public** — login Mulyono Raka (demo-mr).\n\n| Field | Type | Required |\n|---|---|---|\n| code | string | yes |\n| remember | boolean | no (default false) |\n\n**200 OK**\n```json\n{\n  \"data\": {\n    \"accessToken\": \"...\",\n    \"refreshToken\": \"...\",\n    \"expiresIn\": 3600,\n    \"person\": {\n      \"id\": 95,\n      \"fullName\": \"Mulyono Raka\",\n      \"nickname\": null,\n      \"gender\": \"male\",\n      \"birthDate\": \"1945-08-17\",\n      \"status\": \"alive\",\n      \"photoUrl\": null,\n      \"isMarried\": false,\n      \"isLegal\": true,\n      \"spouseIds\": []\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\n**Errors:**\n- 400 `CODE_REQUIRED`\n- 400 `CODE_INVALID_FORMAT`\n- 401 `CODE_NOT_FOUND`\n- 429 `TOO_MANY_ATTEMPTS`"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Login — me MIA210399",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "  const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "  pm.environment.set('accessToken', json.data.accessToken);",
                  "  pm.environment.set('refreshToken', json.data.refreshToken);",
                  "  pm.environment.set('personId', String(json.data.person.id));",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"code\": \"MIA210399\",\n  \"remember\": false\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Login — invalid format",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"code\": \"ABC\"\n}" },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login",
            "description": "Expect **400** `CODE_INVALID_FORMAT`"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Login — code not found",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"code\": \"XXXX010100\"\n}" },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login",
            "description": "Expect **401** `CODE_NOT_FOUND` (sama untuk deceased)"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get me",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{accessToken}}" }],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/me",
            "description": "**Auth required** — includes `readFocusPersonId`, `allowedFocusPersonIds`, `spouseIds`, `isMarried`, `isLegal`.\n\n**401** `UNAUTHORIZED` tanpa/invalid token"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get my options",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{accessToken}}" }],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/me/options",
            "description": "**200 OK** `{ \"data\": { \"options\": { \"readFocusPersonId\": \"84\" } } }`"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Set readFocusPersonId (spouse)",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{accessToken}}" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"setting\": \"readFocusPersonId\",\n  \"value\": \"84\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/me/options",
            "description": "Toggle perspektif Pasangan — setelah ini GET /events, /persons/map, dll. tanpa query focusPersonId."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Refresh token",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "  const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "  pm.environment.set('accessToken', json.data.accessToken);",
                  "  pm.environment.set('refreshToken', json.data.refreshToken);",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"refreshToken\": \"{{refreshToken}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/refresh",
            "description": "**Public** — rotate refresh token.\n\n**200 OK** `{ accessToken, refreshToken, expiresIn }`\n\n**401** `REFRESH_TOKEN_INVALID`"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Logout",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{accessToken}}" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"refreshToken\": \"{{refreshToken}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/logout",
            "description": "**Auth required** — revoke refresh token.\n\n**200 OK** `{ \"data\": { \"loggedOut\": true } }`"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Logs",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Track page view",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{accessToken}}" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"action\": \"page.view\",\n  \"path\": \"/tree\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/logs/events",
            "description": "**201 Created** `{ \"data\": { \"recorded\": true } }`"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Track click",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{accessToken}}" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"action\": \"click\",\n  \"path\": \"/tree\",\n  \"label\": \"Buka profil ayah\",\n  \"metadata\": { \"targetPersonId\": 42 }\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/logs/events"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Track page view — family map",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{accessToken}}" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"action\": \"page.view\",\n  \"path\": \"/family/map\",\n  \"label\": \"Peta Keluarga\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/logs/events"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Track page view — events",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{accessToken}}" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"action\": \"page.view\",\n  \"path\": \"/events\",\n  \"label\": \"Acara\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/logs/events"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Track page view — in memoriam",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{accessToken}}" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"action\": \"page.view\",\n  \"path\": \"/in-memoriam\",\n  \"label\": \"In Memoriam\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/logs/events"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Track event — invalid payload",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"action\": \"invalid\",\n  \"path\": \"\"\n}" },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/logs/events",
            "description": "Expect **400** `INVALID_LOG_EVENT`"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "CORS (Part 4)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Preflight OPTIONS /auth/login",
          "request": {
            "method": "OPTIONS",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Origin", "value": "http://localhost:5173" },
              { "key": "Access-Control-Request-Method", "value": "POST" },
              { "key": "Access-Control-Request-Headers", "value": "Content-Type, Authorization" }
            ],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login",
            "description": "Expect **204** with `Access-Control-Allow-Origin` when origin is listed in `CORS_ORIGINS`."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Persons (Part 5)",
      "description": "Semua endpoint butuh `Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}`. Response camelCase + `generationLabel`/`isSelf` dinamis dari user login.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "List persons (paginated)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{accessToken}}" }],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/persons?page=1&limit=20",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "persons"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "page", "value": "1" },
                { "key": "limit", "value": "20" }
              ]
            },
            "description": "**200 OK** — mode list (default).\n```json\n{\n  \"data\": {\n    \"view\": \"list\",\n    \"rootPersonId\": 83,\n    \"persons\": [ /* max 20 */ ],\n    \"pagination\": {\n      \"page\": 1,\n      \"limit\": 20,\n      \"total\": 95,\n      \"totalPages\": 5,\n      \"hasNext\": true,\n      \"hasPrev\": false\n    }\n  }\n}\n```"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "List persons (tree graph)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{accessToken}}" }],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/persons?view=tree",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "persons"],
              "query": [{ "key": "view", "value": "tree" }]
            },
            "description": "**200 OK** — full tree (v1). Tanpa filter params → `filter.applied=false`, `meta.filtered=false`, `personCount === totalFamilyCount`.\n\nDengan filter params → subgraph v2 (`filter.applied=true`)."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "List persons (tree subgraph — paternal)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{accessToken}}" }],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/persons?view=tree&focusPersonId=83&lineage=paternal&generationsUp=4&showSpouses=false&showSiblings=false&showChildren=false",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "persons"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "view", "value": "tree" },
                { "key": "focusPersonId", "value": "83" },
                { "key": "lineage", "value": "paternal" },
                { "key": "generationsUp", "value": "4" },
                { "key": "showSpouses", "value": "false" },
                { "key": "showSiblings", "value": "false" },
                { "key": "showChildren", "value": "false" }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Subgraph v2 — garis ayah 4 generasi. Expect `meta.personCount` < `meta.totalFamilyCount`."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "List persons (tree subgraph — full preset)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{accessToken}}" }],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/persons?view=tree&focusPersonId=83&lineage=both&generationsUp=4&showSpouses=true&showSiblings=true&showChildren=true",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "persons"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "view", "value": "tree" },
                { "key": "focusPersonId", "value": "83" },
                { "key": "lineage", "value": "both" },
                { "key": "generationsUp", "value": "4" },
                { "key": "showSpouses", "value": "true" },
                { "key": "showSiblings", "value": "true" },
                { "key": "showChildren", "value": "true" }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Subgraph v2 — preset Lengkap (selaras FE filterPersons)."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "List persons (tree filter invalid)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{accessToken}}" }],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/persons?view=tree&generationsUp=0",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "persons"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "view", "value": "tree" },
                { "key": "generationsUp", "value": "0" }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Expect **400** `TREE_FILTER_INVALID`."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "List persons (tree — focus spouse)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{accessToken}}" }],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/persons?view=tree&focusPersonId=84",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "persons"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "view", "value": "tree" },
                { "key": "focusPersonId", "value": "84", "description": "Spouse id — ganti jika beda seed" }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Fokus pohon ke pasangan. Response: `focusPersonId` & `rootPersonId` = 84, `selfPersonId` = user login. **403** `PERSON_READ_FOCUS_FORBIDDEN` jika ID bukan diri sendiri / spouse."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "List persons (tree — focus forbidden)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{accessToken}}" }],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/persons?view=tree&focusPersonId=49",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "persons"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "view", "value": "tree" },
                { "key": "focusPersonId", "value": "49" }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Expect **403** `PERSON_READ_FOCUS_FORBIDDEN` (father bukan spouse login user demo)."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get person by ID",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{accessToken}}" }],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/persons/{{personId}}",
            "description": "Detail satu person dalam family scope."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Create person",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{accessToken}}" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"fullName\": \"Anak Baru Demo\",\n  \"gender\": \"male\",\n  \"birthDate\": \"2026-01-01\",\n  \"status\": \"alive\",\n  \"fatherId\": null,\n  \"motherId\": null,\n  \"spouseIds\": []\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/persons",
            "description": "**201 Created** — login code derived otomatis dari nama+tanggal."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Update person",
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{accessToken}}" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"fullName\": \"Anak Baru Demo Updated\",\n  \"gender\": \"male\",\n  \"birthDate\": \"2026-01-01\",\n  \"status\": \"alive\",\n  \"nickname\": \"Demo\",\n  \"spouseIds\": []\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/persons/{{personId}}",
            "description": "**200 OK** — update person dalam family."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Delete person",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{accessToken}}" }],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/persons/99999",
            "description": "Soft delete. **403** jika hapus diri sendiri sebagai root family."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "List without token",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/persons",
            "description": "Expect **401** `UNAUTHORIZED`"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Map — focus self (83)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{accessToken}}" }],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/persons/map?focusPersonId=83",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "persons", "map"],
              "query": [{ "key": "focusPersonId", "value": "83" }]
            },
            "description": "Peta keluarga scoped subgraph visible dari diri sendiri. Response echo `focusPersonId`, `selfPersonId`, `meta.withExactCoords`."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Map — focus spouse (84)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{accessToken}}" }],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/persons/map?focusPersonId=84",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "persons", "map"],
              "query": [{ "key": "focusPersonId", "value": "84" }]
            },
            "description": "Subset berbeda dari focus 83 — subgraph pasangan."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Patch person address",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{accessToken}}" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"address\": {\n    \"street\": \"Jl. Demo No. 1\",\n    \"city\": \"Kota Malang\",\n    \"province\": \"Jawa Timur\",\n    \"latitude\": -7.9666,\n    \"longitude\": 112.6326\n  }\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/persons/{{personId}}?focusPersonId={{personId}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "persons", "{{personId}}"],
              "query": [{ "key": "focusPersonId", "value": "{{personId}}" }]
            },
            "description": "Gate **isLegal** (18+). **403** `PERSON_UPDATE_FORBIDDEN` jika underage."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Events",
      "description": "Acara keluarga — `focusPersonId` wajib. Lihat docs/MAP-EVENTS-MEMORIAM-API.md.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "List events",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{accessToken}}" }],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/events?focusPersonId=83&page=1&limit=20",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "events"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "focusPersonId", "value": "83" },
                { "key": "page", "value": "1" },
                { "key": "limit", "value": "20" }
              ]
            },
            "description": "List acara dalam perspektif fokus. Restricted events tampil dengan `canAccess: false`."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get event by ID",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{accessToken}}" }],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/events/1?focusPersonId=83",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "events", "1"],
              "query": [{ "key": "focusPersonId", "value": "83" }]
            },
            "description": "**403** `EVENT_ACCESS_FORBIDDEN` untuk restricted event jika viewer bukan attendee."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Create event",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{accessToken}}" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"title\": \"Acara Demo API\",\n  \"type\": \"other\",\n  \"date\": \"2026-07-21\",\n  \"location\": \"Malang\",\n  \"personIds\": [83],\n  \"attendeeIds\": [],\n  \"photoUrls\": []\n}"
            },
            "url": {
